  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">感謝大家下載量突破<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">百萬</span>次！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br>在提交了一個資源包更新的外包請求卻未收到回覆後，</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">鑑於我正在積極更新圖標，我決定將其分享給社群。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">已涵蓋以下模組：</span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alexs-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alex's Mobs 更新（新增 +34 個生物）</a><br></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/625/578/captura-alex-2.jpg\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\"><br></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/artifacts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Artifacts（神器）（偽裝者）</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/capybara-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Capybara Mod（水豚）</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galosphere\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galosphere（靈界）（靈魂）</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/625/581/captura-mimic-capy-galos.jpg\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\"></span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ob-aquamirae\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aquamirae（所有生物）</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/625/584/captura-aqua.jpg\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\"></span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/savage-and-ravage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Savage &amp; Ravage（部分生物）</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/625/585/captura-savage-and-ravage.jpg\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\"></span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knight-quest\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knight Quest（完整覆蓋）</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/625/582/captura-knight-quest.jpg\" width=\"540\"></span></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/l_ender-s-cataclysm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cataclysm（完整覆蓋）</a><br></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/625/583/captura-cataclysm-2.jpg\" width=\"540\" height=\"540\"></p>\n<ul style=\"text-align:center\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\">豬布林（與模組存在 Minecraft 原生兼容性問題）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
